// the parser reports a complete arithmetic expression. If a soft constrained step
// proposes an invalid token, the strategy rolls back to a valid constrained prefix.
// This state supports the task by ensuring arithmetic computations are emitted
// inside delimiters while preserving valid parser prefixes for every active span.
